 {
  "note": "setup: {OUT}_outside (card.png, lime.png), {OUT}/../dc_escape_src.png, junction {OUT}/jx -> {OUT}_outside. Passes with read {IN} + write {OUT} (repo runner, cwd {OUT}/..) and with read {IN}+{OUT} + write {OUT} (plugin, cwd {OUT}). Needs Windows, python and ffmpeg on PATH.",
